  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade mission shipbuilding/maritime infrastructure to Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the upcoming years, the Government of Bangladesh wants to increase investments in the maritime sector and develop the Blue Economy in Bangladesh. This creates trade and investment opportunities for the Dutch Maritime sector.In October 2026, Bangladesh will organize the 8th Edition of the Bangladesh International Marine and Offshore Expo 2026 (BIMOX). A two-day visit to BIMOX will form part of a four-day trade mission to Bangladesh with a Dutch delegation.The goals of this project are to: &#x2022;	strengthen the relationship between Bangladesh and The Netherlands and enhance private sector and economic cooperation in the field of maritime and delta technology;&#x2022;	explore potential opportunities for private and public-private investment opportunities and collaboration between the Dutch and Bangladeshi Maritime and delta technology sectors; &#x2022;	showcase the Dutch expertise and technology and in particularly the interest of the Dutch Maritime, Delta technology and knowledge industry for the Bangladeshi market; and&#x2022;	collect further input for the formulation and implementation of the Bangladesh maritime combi-track.</narrative>
  </description>
